    "introduction": "Experian supplies credit information, data analytics and software to businesses and consumers. Lenders use its information to assess applications and manage existing customers, while other clients use its tools for identity checks, fraud prevention, marketing and operational decisions. Its consumer services help individuals understand credit information and access related products. Revenue comes from data services, software, subscriptions and customer activity across these offerings. The company operates internationally, with different markets having distinct credit systems and data rules. Its business depends on maintaining accurate information, safeguarding personal data and embedding useful tools into customer workflows, alongside the level of borrowing and commercial activity.",
